      "message": "It is not quite the same (e.g. does not work on paths, returns \"\" if they are not relative) and the requirement for a ctx makes it a little difficult to use. However, filepath.Rel() can be used. As the only use case is to resolve a path relative to the build dir I added methods to Config to do that. If you still aren\u0027t happy with that could you suggest where I should put the methods that would allow them to be used in java/ and sdk/ packages and what form they should take?",
